    (base_content_type_id, object_id, to_content_type_id, to_object_id, content_path_hash) [unique, name: 'wagtailcore_referenceindex_base_content_type_id_object_id_to_content_type_id_to_object_id_content_path_hash_9e6ccd6a_uniq']
    (base_content_type_id, object_id) [name: 'referenceindex_source_object']
    (to_content_type_id, to_object_id) [name: 'referenceindex_target_object']
  }

  Note: '''Records references between objects for quick retrieval of object usage.

References are extracted from Foreign Keys, Chooser Blocks in StreamFields, and links in Rich Text Fields.
